title: Payers › History & Changes › Acknowledge a change
route: /payers/cardinal?tab=history
intro: Acknowledging is the first of two gates. It records who saw the payer's change and when, and changes nothing else. 'Review & apply changes' stays locked until it is done, so a person has always read the change before any draft is redrafted. There is no way to take an acknowledgement back.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "Open History & Changes\nof a payer with a waiting change"
screen bn "Ochre card, first on the tab\n'Acknowledge change' (green, ready)\n'Review & apply changes' (greyed out)\nNote: Acknowledging records who saw it. Applying redrafts the unsent drafts,\nand each returns to Case Manager for a new signature.\nA submitted packet is never rewritten, and no active case moves\nto another workflow version without a person reviewing it."
click hv "Hover or click the greyed\n'Review & apply changes'"
toast tip "Tooltip: 'Acknowledge the change first'\nNothing happens on click"
click ca "Click 'Acknowledge change'"
overlay m "Acknowledge this change?\nIt records who saw the change and when."
screen bd "Change shown in a tinted box\n'Criteria changed, version 2026.3'\nProgress evidence must now include the remaining treatment goals.\nEffective 10/15."
process who "'You are acknowledging as {viewer}.\nThis does not change any draft or any workflow.\nApplying the change is a separate step.'"
click ok "Click 'Acknowledge change'\nin the modal"
store st "Acknowledgement recorded on the change\nWho: the person viewing (Jordan Perez at the start). When: the demo clock"
toast t1 "'Change acknowledged'\nRecorded for {viewer}, Tue 10:42 am.\nDrafts are not changed until you update them."
screen bn2 "Card now shows a green pill\n'Acknowledged by {viewer}, Tue 10:42 am'\nin place of the blue button\n'Review & apply changes' is ready"
process nb "No change to the sidebar badge, the dot, the drafts or any workflow\nNo edit log entry. No undo"
click cx "Click 'Cancel'"
click cesc "Press Escape, click the X\nor click the dimmed area"
endx x1 "Modal closes\nNothing recorded\nCard as before"
end e1 "Ready for the second gate"
goto g1 "Continues in: Payers › History & Changes › Review and apply a change"

s1 --> bn
bn --> hv --> tip --> ca
bn --> ca --> m --> bd --> who --> ok --> st --> t1 --> bn2 --> e1
bn2 -.-> nb
e1 --> g1
m --> cx --> x1
m --> cesc --> x1
